<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Kristan's Corner</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
      background: url('A09DB808-8314-462A-9838-0773A512347A.jpeg') no-repeat center center fixed;
      background-size: cover;
      color: #2f2f2f;
      line-height: 1.6;
      position: relative;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px 20px;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 3em;
      color: #3a3a3a;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    header p {
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 1.2em;
      color: #5a5a5a;
    }

    nav {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }

    nav a {
      margin: 0 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #4a4a4a;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    h2 {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #cfcfcf;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    .profile-pic {
      float: right;
      width: 200px;
      margin-left: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    .cats {
      font-style: italic;
      color: #6a5d57;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #7a7a7a;
    }

    a:hover {
      color: #8a574d;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .profile-pic {
        float: none;
        display: block;
        margin: 0 auto 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Kristan</h1>
    <p>Curious mind. Plant lover. Cat herder. Working on being unstoppable.</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#goals">Goals</a>
    <a href="#cats">Cats</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <img src="0CC5473F-CB4F-458F-A833-4E39DB6F7994.jpeg" alt="Kristan Portrait" class="profile-pic" />
    <p>
      I'm Kristan—a driven, music-loving, language-learning, fitness-chasing creative force. I'm on a journey of personal growth, career discovery, and leveling up in all the ways that matter. I thrive on clever conversations, spontaneous ideas, and the occasional existential spiral (with a side of oat milk).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="goals">
    <h2>What I'm Working On</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Strengthening my fitness and mental resilience</li>
      <li>Sharpening my cooking skills—hello, vegetarian flavor explosions</li>
      <li>Becoming conversational in Spanish (¡poco a poco!)</li>
      <li>Finding the right career path where passion and paycheck collide</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="cats">
    <h2>A Note About the Cats</h2>
    <p class="cats">
      I share my space with two mysterious black cats and one sunshine-orange feline. They are my chaos goblins and occasional productivity blockers, but also my fuzzy therapy crew. You'll spot their influence in occasional pawprints and misplaced Zoom cameos.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Let’s Connect</h2>
    <p>
      Curious to collaborate, chat, or hire me? I’m open to opportunities, conversation, and projects that align with creativity, purpose, and growth.
    </p>
    <p>Email me at: <a href="mailto:kristanpasternak@gmail.com">your.email@example.com</a></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 Kristan. Powered by caffeine, playlists, and stubborn optimism.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>